      refs.src.placeholder=mode==='json'?'Paste resume JSON here...':'Paste text here...\n\nNAME: Candidate Name\nJOB TITLE: MIS Executive\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\n...\n\nEXPERIENCE\nMIS Executive — Example Company | Jan 2024 – Present\n- Prepared weekly reporting dashboards.';
